<title>HONG KONG: CKI says signs Guangdong highway deal.</title>
<headline>CKI says signs Guangdong highway deal.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd (CKI) said on Tuesday it had signed a contract to operate a highway in Zengcheng in the southern Chinese province of Guangdong.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it held a 51 percent stake in the HK$200 million, 30-km Zengcheng Lixin Highway, which has been operational since October 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
